  "model": "models/ConnectionTable.tla",
  "scope": "finite models: ConnectionTable (the connection table of Streamable HTTP endpoints with a credential: one or two keys, at most two ensure, one release, one closeAll, one lose, one port deviation; bounds fire in creation order; two keys fire no bound) and Calls (the call port over an abstract table: at most four keys, one correlation key, one task). Safety, and P8 T1 and P14 T1 under weak fairness. No refinement proof between the two models or to the implementation; no real transport, peer or storage.",
